    "body": "Problem: Homebrew no longer supports Intel macOS, and several taps have already vanished.\n\nSolution: Don't force a homebrew update and rely on preinstalled versions.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-04T12:32:02Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "So this seems to work; will add a proper commit message later (and go over runner images to bump already deprecated ones and maybe silence what warnings I can).\r\n\r\nThis is just a short-term stop-gap since GHA will drop Intel runners entirely next year (and macOS 27 doesn't support Intel at all), but this will at least let people without a shiny fruitrock enjoy multicursors for a while...",
            "created_at": "2026-09-04T08:52:32Z",
